SRR8587695	PRJNA523003	SRP186175	SAMN10962532	SRX5388234	Homo sapiens	4-day ML210 treatment	4-day ML210 treatment	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM3611453: 4-day ML210 treatment Homo sapiens OTHER	OTHER	GENOMIC	other	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Genomic DNA from cell pellets was purified using the QIAamp DNA Blood Maxi/Midi/Mini kits (Qiagen) according to the manufacturer's protocols and quantified using a Nanodrop 2000 (Thermo Fisher Scientific). sgRNA cassettes were PCR-amplified and barcoded with sequencing adaptors utilizing ExTaq DNA Polymerase (Clontech). PCR products were purified with Agencourt AMPure XP SPRI beads (Beckman Coulter A63880) according to the manufacturer's instructions, quantified using a Nanodrop 2000, pooled into a master sequencing pool, and sequenced on a MiSeq sequencer (Illumina) with 300nt single-end reads, loaded at 60% with a 5% spike-in of PhiX DNA.	27085145	1354257250	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR858/005/SRR8587695/SRR8587695.fastq.gz	3adfc54542ad5287b59bc1a279887b5e	572597695
